{"id":"1446b9e29d0d93f2","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-lambda-category-compat.md","title":"lambda-category — λ 范畴历史入口","display":"lambda-category — λ 范畴历史入口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-lambda-category-compat","aliases":["16-df-lambda-category-compat","16-lambda-category"],"display":"lambda-category — λ 范畴历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-df-lambda-category]]"],"source":"Definition 2.5.1 and Lemma 2.5.2 p. 155 (PDF 175)","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-lambda-category-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-lambda-category-compat</span><span>16-lambda-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lambda-category — λ 范畴历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9d52b8330bc1b384\" href=\"?note=9d52b8330bc1b384\" title=\"16-df-lambda-category\">16-df-lambda-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 2.5.1 and Lemma 2.5.2 p. 155 (PDF 175)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}\\)</span> 的完整定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d52b8330bc1b384\" href=\"?note=9d52b8330bc1b384\" title=\"16-df-lambda-category\">16-df-lambda-category</a>，其中包含指定对象与应用箭头的存在量词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 为本页的历史谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{legacy}\">\\(\\mathrm{legacy}\\)</span> 仅为该谓词的固定标识下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(\\mathcal C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}(\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(\\mathcal C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}(\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保持历史标签；使用 Definition 2.5.1 / Lemma 2.5.2 的 λ 范畴接口，不再附加自然数对象条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-lambda-category","status":"resolved","id":"9d52b8330bc1b384","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-lambda-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-lambda-category","status":"resolved","id":"9d52b8330bc1b384","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴；$\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}$ 的完整定义见 [[16-df-lambda-category]]，其中包含指定对象与应用箭头的存在量词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{legacy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(\\mathcal C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LambdaCategory}(\\mathcal C).","display":true}],"bytes":995,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-271","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-lambda-category-compat|lambda-category — λ 范畴历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["9d52b8330bc1b384"]}